&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://nas.io/&quot;&gt;Nas.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is building Shopify for the AI era: a platform that helps net-new entrepreneurs find customers and sell online. We’re an AI-first business platform used by 16,000+ entrepreneurs, growing rapidly month over month, and we scaled revenue 5× in 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Backed by leading Silicon Valley VCs and based in Singapore, we’re entering a critical scale phase.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
