&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DBu3ddT8dobslix9wirlLwW8gnh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Be responsible for setting short and long-term strategies with a far reaching impact on all of the product offerings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bk7ydfr25o1io7xmtq1lSGyTgJe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
