&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DLvuddq9EoREK3xAZGFlKUXqgih&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Engage closely with the Engineering team to help determine the best technical implementation methods as well as a reasonable implementation schedule.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqcVdPev7o0AG9xiQi2lOjKkgcg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Understand customer needs and gather product requirements. Identify market opportunities and define product vision and strategy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jd2gdjqHBoNoy3xDEQjlVzi6god&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work closely with the team of product managers and product designers and conduct regular peer-reviews on the deliverables.&lt;/div&gt;
