&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A commitment to holding oneself and others accountable for achieving results.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of proven success as a Technical Recruiter, with experience supporting Customer Success, Engineering or other technical-focused roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s Degree.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to act as a trusted Talent Advisor, influencing and executing hiring strategies with senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
