&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is looking for a compassionate and dedicated Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) to join our team in our Davidson County Visits office. This position services our geriatric clients&amp;nbsp;on a&amp;nbsp;per visit basis in homes throughout Chatham and Lee counties in North Carolina.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;One year prior clinical experience as a Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) is required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;As a home health nurse, you will be an integral member of a multi-disciplinary health care team that provides skilled nursing and rehabilitative care to clients, affording them the opportunity to receive the medical care required to remain at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
